  <item>
    <title>你颜值不行，玩穿搭就毫无意义？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6803ab8fcdd692da155fa561</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6803ab8fcdd692da155fa561</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 27 Apr 2025 04:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>一直以来，穿搭博主的留言区，都会有两派观点：</span></p><span></span><p><span>颜值决定论 vs 穿搭改变论</span></p><span></span><p><span>一派认为：只要你长得帅，身材好，那么穿什么都无所谓，都帅，如果你颜值不行，那么穿什么都没用，还是丑。</span></p><span></span><p><span>另一个派的观点是：正是因为大多数人颜值不行，所以才需要学穿搭来提升自己的魅力。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目的目标，是希望能探讨出一个真相，给自认为自己的颜值是普通人的兄弟们，提供一些实用的建议。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00:00</a> 开场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="41">00:00:41</a> 两派观点：颜值决定论 vs 穿搭改变论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="514">00:08:34</a> 为什么颜值决定论似乎有道理&amp;实例</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="710">00:11:50</a> 为什么普通人不要复制明星穿搭？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="897">00:14:57</a> 嘉宾聊下自己的颜值</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1331">00:22:11</a> 颜值对工作和恋爱的重要吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1863">00:31:03</a> 那为什么演艺圈的明星都是帅哥美女？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2125">00:35:25</a> 为什么潮流博主普遍颜值不高？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2336">00:38:56</a> 是博主都太丑？还是大众审美偏差？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2441">00:40:41</a> 陈冠希是颜值明星还是穿搭icon？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2553">00:42:33</a> 为什么吴彦祖、彭于晏、周杰伦不是穿搭icon？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2896">00:48:16</a> 穿搭改变论的实例</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3301">00:55:01</a> 欧美新热穿搭icon Matty Matheson 给我们的启示</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3846">01:04:06</a> 如何才能算穿搭届的一代宗师？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3936">01:05:36</a> 最终建议：普通人如何该如何看待颜值和穿搭？</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6543b40bde390991a49aa526/lifODKJ4dnTw_pUTGwUbNo35Amud.m4a" length="70394138" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:12:32</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs8kRq4HQJNPZDqw2-7spZFNYH7I.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>我花了大价钱入手，却绝不再穿的潮流单品</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67e9f34f8eecdbeb6029abee</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67e9f34f8eecdbeb6029abee</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 13 Apr 2025 03:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>今天我们分享了一些单品，包括了“潮流单品”+“高价”+“不再穿”这三个要素。</span></p><span></span><p><span>为什么曾经特别热爱，如今来看，就是在穿搭上走了弯路？</span></p><span></span><p><span>“你有没有买过超贵但后悔的单品？”</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们会分享为什么买？当时怎么想的？现在为什么不穿？</span></p><span></span><p><span>这些时代的眼泪，相信你的箱子里也会压着那么几件。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00:00</a> 开场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="165">00:02:45</a> 分享下OOTD</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="655">00:10:55</a> 安逸猿第1件 LV Trainer</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1218">00:20:18</a> 高老师第1件 朴宰范同款Diesel</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1603">00:26:43</a> 猿哥第1件 Neighborhood横须贺夹克</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2100">00:35:00</a> 安逸猿第2件 Evisu牛仔裤</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2586">00:43:06</a> 高老师第2件 LEMAIRE西服</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2781">00:46:21</a> 猿哥第2件 Neighborhood印花T</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3198">00:53:18</a> 安逸猿第3件 BAPE鲨鱼头帽T</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3867">01:04:27</a> 高老师第3件 The Real McCoy's ivy风西服</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3955">01:05:55</a> 猿哥第3件 Neighborhood外套系列</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4380">01:13:00</a> 总结下这些时代的眼泪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4446">01:14:06</a> 玩穿搭 学费是避免不了的</span></p>]]></description>
