  <item>
    <title>潮流穿搭鄙视链漫谈 究竟谁的穿搭是龙鸣？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67d55e020766616acd235ece</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67d55e020766616acd235ece</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 29 Mar 2025 04:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>衣服为什么一定要被分成三六九等？</span></p><span></span><p><span>贵的衣服，限量的衣服，就一定更优越吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>穿搭爱好者之间的大战，比如咔叽和玩嘻哈美潮的人，虽然都是美系穿搭，但互相看不惯，旁边的老钱风的笑而不语。</span></p><span></span><p><span>所有人心中都有鄙视链，但是为何不说出来？</span></p><span></span><p><span>那么不同穿搭风格之间的矛盾，是不是不可化解？</span></p><span></span><p><span>鄙视链的根源在哪里？</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果我被鄙视了，我该怎么办？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00:00</a> 开场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="351">00:05:51</a> 落伍鄙视链</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="585">00:09:45</a> 爆款鄙视链</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="820">00:13:40</a> 正品鄙视链</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="865">00:14:25</a> 限量鄙视链</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1150">00:19:10</a> 价位鄙视链</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1450">00:24:10</a> 各类风格互相鄙视</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1815">00:30:15</a> 鄙视链无处不在（音乐、科技、员工）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2085">00:34:45</a> 鄙视链的人性根源解析</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2388">00:39:48</a> 什么是蒸发冷却效应</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2563">00:42:43</a> 被鄙视，我该怎么办？实用的建议</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3170">00:52:50</a> 穿搭只是第一步</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3700">01:01:40</a> 总结下</span></p>]]></description>
