  <item>
    <title>潮流博主的一年收支大公开，自媒体经营心得分享</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67be67ad05a90dfd0ddf3bb8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67be67ad05a90dfd0ddf3bb8</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 07 Mar 2025 09:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>频道经营到第4个年头，也许有人会好奇，潮流博主r究竟能赚多少？</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天我将全面公开我的收入给大家参考。</span></p><span></span><p><span>包括YT广告分润、会员收入、业配收入所占的比例。</span></p><span></span><p><span>收入以外，我还会分享4年来自媒体的经营心得，包括YT、抖音、B站、小红书等平台的差异。</span></p><span></span><p><span>博主如何在Netflix和枓音Tiktok的双重夹击下求生？</span></p><span></span><p><span>究竟娱乐型和干货型的YTer的差异化在哪里？</span></p><span></span><p><span>为什么我不建议大家做抖音？</span></p><span></span><p><span>接业配对YTer的坏处在哪里？</span></p><span></span><p><span>我在用怎样的原则来平衡创作和商业的平衡？</span></p><span></span><p><span>相信看完本篇，会对很多有志成为自媒体的朋友有些参考价值。</span></p><span></span><p><span>东京情报猿的Podcast节目【Cold Beer Talk第二季】全新开启，漫谈日本潮流穿搭文化～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00:00</a> 开场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="190">00:03:10</a> Cold Beer Talk第二季开启</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="230">00:03:50</a> YT广告分润？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1530">00:25:30</a> 付费会员收入？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2290">00:38:10</a> 业配收入？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2850">00:47:30</a> 如何平衡创作热情和商业变现？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3010">00:50:10</a> 频道支出分析</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3250">00:54:10</a> 各大平台运营现状和心得（抖音、B站、Youtube、小红书、Podcast、CBC社群）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4030">01:07:10</a> 总结结论</span></p>]]></description>
